# Trivy vulnerability exceptions
# Add CVE IDs here when:
#   1. No fix is available (upstream hasn't patched)
#   2. The vulnerability is not exploitable in this context
#   3. The risk is reviewed and accepted
#
# Format: CVE-ID [,optional: comment]
#
# Examples:
# CVE-2024-XXXXX  # transitive dep, no patch available, risk accepted
